hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"974","Abu Bakr said: Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Sa`id al-Khudri reported on the authority of his father: We withheld prayer on the Day of the Trench, until he was among those who I took it out at night in a different place, and in the report he ordered Bilal to perform the noon prayer, then he performed the afternoon prayer, then he performed the sunset prayer, then He made dinner."
